grantctl (1.0.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * First release of grantctl, the Rust successor of nst-cockpit.
  * One binary for the control node and every managed node; the control side
    reaches `grantctl node ...` over SSH.
  * Changes are applied as widen, switch, narrow: access is only removed
    after the new sudoers and sshd rules are validated and live.
  * Passwords follow the control node unless changed on a node.

 -- Krushn Dayshmookh <krushndayshmookh@gmail.com>  Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +0530
